/div><div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><b class=\"lsj-sense-n\">2.</b>  metaph., <i>hunt, seek after,</i> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">κερδέων μέτρον</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Pi.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">N.</i> 11.47</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">γάμους</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">A.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Pr.</i> 858</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ἀρετάν</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">E.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">IA</i> 568</span></span> (lyr.); <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">θ. νέους πλουσίους ὀρφανούς</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Aeschin.</span> 1.170</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ἡδονάς, ἐπιστήμην,</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Isoc.</span> 1.16</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Pl.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Tht.</i> 200a</span>, al.; [<span class=\"lsj-greek\">εὐδαιμονίαν</span>] <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Arist.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Pol.</i> 1328b1</span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ὀνόματα, ῥήματα,</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Pl.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Grg.</i> 489b</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">And.</span> 1.9</span>, cf. <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Antipho</span> 6.18</span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">τὰς ἀρχὰς τῶν συλλογισμῶν</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Arist.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">APr.</i> 46a11</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">θ. τὸν πλησίον,</span> of an orator, <span class=\"lsj-author\">Phld.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Rh.</i> 2.5 <span class=\"lsj-author\">S.</span>, al.—Trag. preferred <span class=\"lsj-greek\">θηράω,</span> exc. where metre demanded <span class=\"lsj-greek\">θηρεύω</span>.</div>"}}